out a care in the world. As time progressed, companies eventually realized that they could collect small pieces of information from a user\u2019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":180818,"global_rank":402986},{"name":"addyg/NewsWebsiteCrawler","owner":"addyg","html_url":"https://github.com/addyg/NewsWebsiteCrawler","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Crawl news websites with Crawler4j","topics":[],"score":180818,"global_rank":402987},{"name":"davidklett/katacoda-scenarios","owner":"davidklett","html_url":"https://github.com/davidklett/katacoda-scenarios","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Katacoda Scenarios","topics":[],"score":180818,"global_rank":402988},{"name":"allaway/r-dose-response","owner":"allaway","html_url":"https://github.com/allaway/r-dose-response","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A list of R dose-response packages","topics":[],"score":180818,"global_rank":402989},{"name":"spunt/psci-socialnonsocial","owner":"spunt","html_url":"https://github.com/spunt/psci-socialnonsocial","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Matlab","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180817,"global_rank":402990},{"name":"vivekaxl/CV","owner":"vivekaxl","html_url":"https://github.com/vivekaxl/CV","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"TeX","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180817,"global_rank":402991},{"name":"stevengum/arm-templates-for-samples","owner":"stevengum","html_url":"https://github.com/ste